{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13201150","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13201150","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1320115001:0":{"text":"助かった……このまま一生リーフベアーかと思いましたよ。","source_cn":"差点以为，要做一辈子叶角熊了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x971D81F5BEA79007","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1320115001":{"text":"助かった……このまま一生リーフベアーかと思いましたよ。","source_cn":"差点以为，要做一辈子叶角熊了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x971D81F5BEA79007","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320115002:0":{"text":"とあるメイジにやられたんですよ！","source_cn":"嗐！是那位魔法师！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2C8C12279817D9BF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"とあるメイジにやられたんですよ！","female":"とあるメイジにやられたんですよ！","variant_male_record_index":"145504","variant_female_record_index":"145505","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320115003:0":{"text":"姿もはっきり覚えてます！青い服を着て、丸眼鏡をして、金髪のマッシュルームカットで……","source_cn":"我记得他穿着蓝衣服，带着圆框眼镜，金发，留着锅盖头……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFBDC3C8BFD4BB029","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"姿もはっきり覚えてます！青い服を着て、丸眼鏡をして、金髪のマッシュルームカットで……","female":"姿もはっきり覚えてます！青い服を着て、丸眼鏡をして、金髪のマッシュルームカットで……","variant_male_record_index":"145506","variant_female_record_index":"145507","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320115004:0":{"text":"そ、それってあのお祭りにいた……","source_cn":"这、这不就是祭典上的那个——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1AD982D80AFB588","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320115005:0":{"text":"ええ、あのおっちょこちょいのメイジさんね。","source_cn":"那个蹩脚魔法师。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2214FEB6AABE34BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320115006:1":{"text":"魔法を慎重に使わないと、取り返しのつかないことになってしまうのです。","source_cn":"魔法是一门严谨的艺术！稍有不慎后果不堪设想！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB6D54C4433F91FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320115007:0":{"text":"私はね、動物の生活を体験してみたかったんですよ。","source_cn":"我想体验一下动物的生活，他说能帮我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2889DC9A5CFC8927","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320115008:0":{"text":"彼は数時間で戻ると言ったのに、数日経っても元の姿に戻らない！","source_cn":"本来说过几小时就会变回来的，谁知道我一连几天都没复原！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F73EE3069F90160","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320115009:0":{"text":"誰かに助けを求めようにも、この姿ではみんな怖がって逃げるだけ……","source_cn":"人们见到我就害怕，也根本没法交流……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA931DDFF8E2E3A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320115010:0":{"text":"かといって、リーフベアーの群れにも受け入れられません。","source_cn":"也没办法融入叶角熊群。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8FE5FC60826FEB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320115011:0":{"text":"分かってますよ、天才が仲間外れにされることくらい……","source_cn":"我懂，被排挤是天才的宿命……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D0A42591E59505E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320115012:0":{"text":"元気を出して、人々が天才の帰還を待っていますから。","source_cn":"好啦，天才现在该入世啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B3516A8DBEC448D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"でも、なぜリーフベアーの姿に？","source_cn":"你怎么变成叶角熊了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6B2B88D3BCD7723A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"でも、なぜリーフベアーの姿に？","female":"でも、なぜリーフベアーの姿に？","variant_male_record_index":"68854","variant_female_record_index":"68855","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320115013:0":{"text":"私「メモ」を書こうとしてたけど、なぜか文字が思い浮かばなくて、だから矢印の絵を描いてその場所を示したんです。","source_cn":"我心里想着“笔记”，但是画出来，就变得什么都不像了，根...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0BEC9CEE84DAA125","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"私「メモ」を書こうとしてたけど、なぜか文字が思い浮かばなくて、だから矢印の絵を描いてその場所を示したんです。","female":"私「メモ」を書こうとしてたけど、なぜか文字が思い浮かばなくて、だから矢印の絵を描いてその場所を示したんです。","variant_male_record_index":"145517","variant_female_record_index":"145518","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320115014:0":{"text":"リーフベアーになると、認識が変わってしまうのでしょうね……","source_cn":"看来作为叶角熊，认知会被改变啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97C8FEDBE147BEB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:1:2":{"text":"なぜ矢印を描いたんだ？","source_cn":"为什么要画箭头？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD6349281CF3E18D5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"なぜ矢印を描いたんだ？","female":"なぜ矢印を描いたの？","variant_male_record_index":"68856","variant_female_record_index":"68857","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320115015:0":{"text":"書きたくても書けないんですよ！","source_cn":"不是我不想写，是写不出来！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6DDA9C9AA73E0843","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"書きたくても書けないんですよ！","female":"書きたくても書けないんですよ！","variant_male_record_index":"145520","variant_female_record_index":"145521","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320115016:0":{"text":"変身のせいで、頭がぐちゃぐちゃになってしまって……","source_cn":"变成叶角熊之后，脑子浑浑噩噩的。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC5C56AE5552CD458","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"変身のせいで、頭がぐちゃぐちゃになってしまって……","female":"変身のせいで、頭がぐちゃぐちゃになってしまって……","variant_male_record_index":"145522","variant_female_record_index":"145523","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320115017:0":{"text":"言葉がまったく思い出せない。","source_cn":"根本记不起文字了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1FA5C5A10335C34A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"言葉がまったく思い出せない。","female":"言葉がまったく思い出せない。","variant_male_record_index":"145524","variant_female_record_index":"145525","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1320115018:0":{"text":"おそらく、記憶の領域に影響を与えたのでしょう。","source_cn":"唔，看来记忆会受到影响啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BFB5082925CDEE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:2:3":{"text":"なぜ直接文字を書いて伝えなかったんだ？","source_cn":"为什么不直接写字呢？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x25B6EAC5986D5EAC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"なぜ直接文字を書いて伝えなかったんだ？","female":"なぜ直接文字を書いて伝えなかったの？","variant_male_record_index":"68858","variant_female_record_index":"68859","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1320115019:0":{"text":"あっ！そ、その前に、もう一度リーフベアーを観察したいです。","source_cn":"啊！我、我还想再观察一下叶角熊。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA26E03F9719FEE92","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"あっ！そ、その前に、もう一度リーフベアーを観察したいです。","female":"あっ！そ、その前に、もう一度リーフベアーを観察したいです。","variant_male_record_index":"145527","variant_female_record_index":"145528","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1320115020:0":{"text":"まさか、リーフベアーの生活に未練ですか！？","source_cn":"你这是还怀念叶角熊的生活吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80D885770AA14909","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1320115021:0":{"text":"いや、私の中にある疑問が浮かんでいて、もう一度観察すれば腑に落ちそうなんです。","source_cn":"我感觉有个问题就要想通了，我预感答案就在我的眼前了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA8EF55E6804DB9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1320115022:0":{"text":"この疑問をはっきりさせなければ、私は一生後悔する！","source_cn":"放弃这个灵感，我一定会后悔终生的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C5E39096B169426","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1320115023:0":{"text":"お願いします、遠くから見るだけでも大丈夫です！","source_cn":"拜托了，让我远远地看看就好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71A383070045B6E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:3:4":{"text":"でも無事でよかった、町まで送るよ。","source_cn":"没事就好，带你回镇子","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x84F0FA8E0A0EFC7D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"でも無事でよかった、町まで送るよ。","female":"でも無事でよかった、町まで送るわ。","variant_male_record_index":"68860","variant_female_record_index":"68861","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:哲学家苏格拉汀":{"text":"哲学者ソクラティス","source":"哲学家苏格拉汀","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"メイメイ","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":29,"localized_text_count":28,"speaker_count":3}}